                'replaces' => 'the spell-like ability racial trait',
                'source' => 'Source PZO9280',
                'description' => 'Descended from undead nobility some dhampirs inherit a bit of their ancestors’ ability to control living beings. They can use command and charm person each once per day. This racial trait replaces the spell-like ability racial trait. Source PZO9280',
                'full_text' => 'Heir to Undying Nobility : Descended from undead nobility some dhampirs inherit a bit of their ancestors’ ability to control living beings. They can use command and charm person each once per day. This racial trait replaces the spell-like ability racial trait. Source PZO9280',
