                'full_text' => 'Vampire Hunter : Some dhampirs bear a deep hatred for their undead progenitors and their kin that can never be fully quenched. They gain a +1 bonus on attack rolls against vampires . This racial trait replaces manipulative. Source PZO9280',
            ],
            [
