                'full_text' => 'Fey Resilience : Even gathlains who leave the First World can retain a bit of the supernatural resilience shared by many fey . A gathlain with this racial trait gains DR 1/ cold iron . This DR increases by 1 for every 5 HD the gathlain has. This replaces the spell-like abilities racial trait. Source PPC:WO',
