                'full_text' => 'Magical Absorption : Many ghorans are resistant to magic or able to dispel it. Some ghorans even gain nourishment from absorbing magic. Whenever such a ghoran succeeds at a saving throw against a spell or spell-like ability , she regains 1 hit point per level of the spell, though this affects the ghoran only if she is above 0 hit points . A ghoran can use this ability a number of times per day equal to her level. This replaces past-life knowledge and nature magic. Source PPC:WO',
