                'full_text' => 'Occult Scion : Created in part from an esoteric ritual, many ghorans are innately sensitive to psychic powers and influences. The ghoran gains Psychic Sensitivity as a bonus feat and treats Knowledge (arcana) and Knowledge (planes) as class skills. This replaces past-life knowledge. Source PZO1140',
