                'source' => null,
                'description' => 'Goblins who live within the boundaries of human cities survive by scavenging for refuse and hunting stray animals . Goblins with this trait gain a +2 racial bonus on Perception and Survival checks, and can use Survival to forage for food while in a city. This racial trait replaces skilled.',
                'full_text' => 'City Scavenger Goblins who live within the boundaries of human cities survive by scavenging for refuse and hunting stray animals . Goblins with this trait gain a +2 racial bonus on Perception and Survival checks, and can use Survival to forage for food while in a city. This racial trait replaces skilled.',
