                'source' => null,
                'description' => 'Gripplis often live in close proximity to very large animals and dangerous creatures they must learn to avoid in order to survive. They gain a +2 dodge bonus to AC against Large or larger animals and magical beasts . This racial trait replaces swamp stride and weapon familiarity. Source PZO9280',
                'full_text' => 'Defensive Training : Gripplis often live in close proximity to very large animals and dangerous creatures they must learn to avoid in order to survive. They gain a +2 dodge bonus to AC against Large or larger animals and magical beasts . This racial trait replaces swamp stride and weapon familiarity. Source PZO9280',
