                'full_text' => 'Bullying : Tieflings are often disparaged and kept low in the social order, where they commonly resort to robbing those weaker than themselves. Tieflings with this racial trait gain a +1 racial bonus on combat maneuver checks to disarm or steal . This racial trait replaces skilled. Source PZO9280',
