                'full_text' => 'Fiendish Sprinter Some tieflings have feet that are more bestial than human . Whether their feet resemble those of a clawed predator or are the cloven hooves common to many of their kind, tieflings with this trait gain a 10-foot racial bonus to their speed when using the charge , run, or withdraw actions. This racial trait replaces skilled.',
